<div class="intro-content axis-page other-axis-page">
  <section>
    <h2>Project-specific axes</h2>
    <p>
      <code>Other</code> groups project-specific axes that do not describe one
      of the broader transformations in the parent-axis framework. They remain
      parametric axes, but are recorded separately because their purpose is
      specific to the source structure of a particular project.
    </p>
    <p>
      They do not inherit a shared parent-axis transformation, so their names,
      ranges, and use are interpreted within the project that defines them.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>

